{"4711790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeon Wage", "steam_appid": 4711790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <strong>Dungeon Wage</strong>, an immersive VR dungeon crawler where danger, greed, and survival collide. Enter mysterious portals, descend into ever-changing dungeons, and face brutal enemies in search of treasure, rare relics, and resources worth risking your life for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in this world, survival is not free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition is part of a high-stakes loop: <strong>enter the dungeon, grab everything you can, escape before time runs out, sell your loot, upgrade your gear, and prepare for the next run</strong>. The deeper you go, the greater the rewards — but the pressure keeps rising. Enemies grow stronger. Costs increase. Your choices matter more with every return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield weapons with your own hands, mine valuable crystals, search for hidden treasures, and feel the weight of every strike through physics-driven VR combat. Whether you play solo or team up with friends, <strong>Dungeon Wage</strong> turns every run into a tense fight between courage and greed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend wisely. Fight smart. Escape alive.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <strong>Dungeon Wage</strong>, an immersive VR dungeon crawler where danger, greed, and survival collide. Enter mysterious portals, descend into ever-changing dungeons, and face brutal enemies in search of treasure, rare relics, and resources worth risking your life for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in this world, survival is not free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition is part of a high-stakes loop: <strong>enter the dungeon, grab everything you can, escape before time runs out, sell your loot, upgrade your gear, and prepare for the next run</strong>. The deeper you go, the greater the rewards — but the pressure keeps rising. Enemies grow stronger. Costs increase. Your choices matter more with every return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield weapons with your own hands, mine valuable crystals, search for hidden treasures, and feel the weight of every strike through physics-driven VR combat. Whether you play solo or team up with friends, <strong>Dungeon Wage</strong> turns every run into a tense fight between courage and greed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend wisely. Fight smart. Escape alive.</p>", "short_description": "Dungeon Wage is a VR fantasy dungeon crawler where every run is a race for loot, survival, and your next payday. Fight, mine, loot, escape — then spend your hard-earned gold on shelter, upgrades, and the gear you need to dive even deeper.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711790/a50bbc26382f7440aa0dfbb9861f79da284377ee/header.jpg?t=1779787875", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711790/dc9e8e6653096619912c3384199c51475636da7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779787875", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711790/dc9e8e6653096619912c3384199c51475636da7e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779787875", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon RX 580 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows-compatible audio device<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR compatible headset required. Meta Quest 2 / Meta Quest 3 supported via Quest Link, Air Link, or Steam Link.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> VR headset and motion controllers required. Performance may vary depending on headset resolution and connection method.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Interchainly"], "publishers": ["Interchainly"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 18, "description": "Partial Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711790/9f054aa866b291e93f34fe814009449c11ff45e2/ss_9f054aa866b291e93f34fe814009449c11ff45e2.600x338.jpg?t=1779787875", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711790/9f054aa866b291e93f34fe814009449c11ff45e2/ss_9f054aa866b291e93f34fe814009449c11ff45e2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779787875"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711790/ce83c354df402d50bd1566ce40a6ed2dff3777d3/ss_ce83c354df402d50bd1566ce40a6ed2dff3777d3.600x338.jpg?t=1779787875", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711790/ce83c354df402d50bd1566ce40a6ed2dff3777d3/ss_ce83c354df402d50bd1566ce40a6ed2dff3777d3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779787875"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4711790/2921df3a3e0f24be1440ef001415f6f0490a6deb/ss_2921df3a3e0f24be1440ef001415f6f0490a6deb.600x338.jpg?t=1779787875", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/471179